    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing that worries me is how easy it is for data to just \"go missing\" or for small unauthorized access to happen without me knowing. what are the specific rules for notifying people if there's some kind of sneaky leak or if data is being accessed in ways that aren't obvious?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
