      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Under GDPR, you must notify the relevant supervisory authority of a personal data breach within 72 hours of becoming aware of it, unless you can demonstrate that this notification is likely to adversely affect the rights and freedoms of individuals. If the breach is considered large and high risk, you must also inform the affected customers without undue delay. Make sure you establish a robust data breach response plan, including regular monitoring and enforcing access controls to prevent any unauthorized access from happening.",
